[en.FOCUS_C12_GLORY_BELONGS_TO_PIE_FAMILY]
Glory belongs to the Pie family

[en.FOCUS_C12_GLORY_BELONGS_TO_PIE_FAMILY_desc]
All ponies, do not forget the suffering you have endured. Reflect on all the pain and oppression you have faced over the years. But also, do not forget who gave you a second chance at life, allowing you the opportunity to seek vengeance against the Empire. Transform your anger into motivation. Long live Limestone Pie! Long live the Pie family! March towards Canterlot!

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GLORY_BELONGS_TO_PIE_FAMILY]
荣耀属于派家

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GLORY_BELONGS_TO_PIE_FAMILY_desc]
所有小马们，不要忘记你们曾经遭受的苦难，好好思考你们这些年来受到的所有痛苦和压迫，但是也不要忘记是谁给予了你们第二次生命，让你们有机会亲自向帝国寻仇。将你们的愤怒转化为动力吧，石青派万岁，派家族万岁！向着坎特洛特进军！

